<title>URUGUAY: Uruguayan foreign debt dropped to $2.3 bln in Nov.</title>
<headline>Uruguayan foreign debt dropped to $2.3 bln in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>MONTEVIDEO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uruguay's net foreign debt fell 0.7 percent to $2.3 billion at the end of November from $2.32 billion in October, the central bank said Wednesday.</p>
<p>However, foreign debt rose 6.3 percent from the end of 1995, when it stood at $2.17 billion.</p>
<p>Foreign reserves stood at $2.46 billion in November.</p>
<p>((-- Montevideo Newsroom + 5982 92 03 36))</p>
